  "question": {
    "text": "The area of the region enclosed by the parabolas $y=x^2-5 x$ and $y=7 x-x^2$ is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "72",
  "solution": {
    "text": "$y=x^2-5 x$ and $y=7 x-x^2$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/NLoYceQZxgz9JzxxBKW-lui5ZtYcpDG0Lw4PkYRBFzI.original.fullsize.png\"><br />$\\begin{aligned} & \\int_0^6(g(x)-f(x)) d x \\\\ & \\int_0^6\\left(\\left(7 x-x^2\\right)-\\left(x^2-5 x\\right)\\right) d x \\\\ & \\int_0^6\\left(12 x-2 x^2\\right) d x=\\left[12 \\frac{x^2}{2}-\\frac{2 x^3}{3}\\right]_0^6 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow 6(6)^2-\\frac{2}{3}(6)^3 \\\\ & =216-144=72 \\text { unit }^2 \\\\ & \\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
